  "card": "Adds test cases to `script_tests.json` and `feature_taproot.py` covering the 1,000-element stack size boundary during P2SH and redeemScript evaluation. Existing test vectors do not exercise this boundary before the scriptPubKey runs, allowing alternative node implementations that check the redeemScript hash without executing the scriptPubKey to accept invalid 1,000-item spends while passing the entire test suite. Enables dumping the new spender transaction to QA script test assets (bitcoin-core/qa-assets#297).",
